{
  "section": "during-workout-sodium",
  "engine": "OfflineMacroCalculator.calculateDuringWorkoutHydration (sodium fields)",
  "note": "sodiumRate = round(recommendedFluidRate/1000 * conc). Fluid rate inherited from the ratified hydration slice (precise/round3dp). Asserts only fields present in 'expected'.",
  "vectors": [
